{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309720","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309720","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1130972001:1":{"text":"네! 저랑 티보는 쌍둥이라서 똑같이 생겼어요.","source_cn":"没错！我和提布是双胞胎，长得一模一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0EA607922DF8C7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130972002:1":{"text":"지금 저희 셋이 숨바꼭질 중인데, 프리아는 찾았는데 티보를 못 찾겠어요...","source_cn":"我们三个在玩捉迷藏，可是我找到普里亚之后，怎么也找不到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x883DA48F6B62EA14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130972003:1":{"text":"어른들이 밖은 위험하다고 했으니까… 설마 혼자 오아시스로 돌아간 걸까요?","source_cn":"他会不会先回绿洲了？毕竟大人们都说，外面很不安全……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A5862632563D02B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血普里亚":{"text":"프리아","source":"蛮血普里亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:蛮血恩狄":{"text":"엔디브","source":"蛮血恩狄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}